    {
        "content": "<p>My question was answered in a different thread by Robin Arnez:<br>\n<a class=\"stream-topic\" data-stream-id=\"217875\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/217875-Is-there-code-for-X.3F/topic/Question.20about.20sizeOf/with/616151549\">#Is there code for X? &gt; Question about sizeOf</a> <br>\nwhich really opened my eyes.</p>",
